# Secret references for tenant "demo". NAMES ONLY. No values, ever.
#
# Each line: <logical name> -> <environment variable that holds the value>.
# The engine resolves these from the host environment at runtime
# (core/engine/config.py: TenantConfig.resolve_secret); tenant.toml
# [secrets] and [llm.tiers].*.api_key_env carry the same names. Provision
# the variables on the host (an env file the container reads, a secrets
# manager, or the shell) before the adapter that needs them runs.
#
qbo_client_id        -> DEMO_QBO_CLIENT_ID
qbo_client_secret    -> DEMO_QBO_CLIENT_SECRET
model_key            -> DEMO_MODEL_KEY
